<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F7F5F0', padding: '0px' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'relative', width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 60px' }}>

        <Box style={{ height: 150, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, letterSpacing: 3, color: '#2F5BE4', marginBottom: 10 }}>0 4 · 技 术 铁 律</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
                模型只负责<span style={{ color: '#2F5BE4' }}>提问</span>，答案必须来自<span style={{ color: '#2F5BE4' }}>真实检索</span>。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 470 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.60)', marginBottom: 34 }}>
                这是防幻觉唯一可靠的方式 —— 也是我们宁可产出少、也不刷数量的原因。
            </Text>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 14 }}>

                <Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F5BE4', letterSpacing: 2 }}>STEP 1</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A', marginTop: 8 }}>模型判立场</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.65)', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        只回答「这段文本站在二元议题的哪一边」，不产出任何内容。
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ width: 34, alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 30 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.25)' }}>→</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F5BE4', letterSpacing: 2 }}>STEP 2</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A', marginTop: 8 }}>去真实源检索</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.65)', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        拿议题词去 V2EX / 掘金 / CSDN 抓真实帖子，候选必须带可访问 URL。
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ width: 34, alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 30 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.25)' }}>→</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C', letterSpacing: 2 }}>STEP 3</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#14161A', marginTop: 8 }}>证据必须可校验</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.65)', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>证据必须是原文的真实子串</span>，对不上就丢，不降级。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 52, paddingTop: 20, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(20,22,26,0.10)', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C', width: 96 }}>我们拒绝</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.62)', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    让模型「写一段反对意见」再去配个链接 —— 写得越像，越难被发现是编的。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, background: '#14161A', borderRadius: 8, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(247,245,240,0.45)', letterSpacing: 1 }}>抽出来的一条证据（可直接核对）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(247,245,240,0.88)', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    evidence_span = 「CEO 觉得微服务部署极其繁琐……要求把十来个微服务合并成一个」
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(247,245,240,0.45)' }}>https://www.v2ex.com/t/1106152</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F5BE4' }}>校验通过：与原文逐字一致</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, bottom: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.40)' }}>ANTIPODE · TECHATHON 2026</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(20,22,26,0.40)' }}>05 / 09</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
